techniques.jsonl is derived from claude-red by SnailSploit / Kai Aizen
Source: https://github.com/SnailSploit/claude-red
License: MIT (see below)

Each line is a condensed "card" built from one Skills/<category>/<name>/SKILL.md by
agent/knowledge/claude_red/build.py: the skill's frontmatter description plus a capped digest of
its offensive methodology sections. The full, unmodified SKILL.md files live in the upstream
repository; only a summary is vendored here, for retrieval in the agent's technique KB.

